    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38713" root="مطر" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْطُورٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  A place, (K,) and a valley, (A,)
<i>rained upon,</i> or <i>watered by rain;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطِيرٌ</span></b> ;
(A, K, TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطِرٌ</span></b> , as in a verse cited
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطْوَةٌ</span>: and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطِيرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطِيرَةٌ</span></b>  applied
to a land (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>). (TA.)

